{"n": 1083, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1083.webp", "text": "» 30 $4 057\n\n3054059\n\n5434 ....REMOVING COMPLETE\nCONVERTIBLE TOP\n\nRemove both rear side trim panels —\nsee 51 43 000.\nOpen the top:\n\nDisconnect plugs of microswitches\nand Insert them through the rubber\ngrommets.\n\nUnscrew the light bulb tester for Check\nControl.\n\nInstallation:\nOnly connect plugs with the same\nnumbers.\n\n1. Top box lid closed (left)\n2 Topbox lid locked\n\n3 Toprunin\n\n4 Top run out\n\n5 Tensloner up\n\n6 Top box lid closed (right)\n\nUnscrew hydraulic pipes.\n\nInstallation:\n\nReplace gaskets.\n\nPipes and connections on the hydraulic\nelement are marked.\n\nTightening torque*.\n\n* See Specifications\n\n{\n\n30 54 060\n\n30 54 067\n\nMark location of top box lid locks on\nthe body.\nUnscrew locks.\n\nDisconnect left and right hydraulic\npipes.\n\nInstallation:\nTightening torque’.\n\nUnscrew bolts and take off top.\nThe top Is aligned with the body -\ndon't mix up washers (1).\n\nClose the top, supporting top motion\nby hand, after finishing Installation.\nCorrect the oll level.\n\nOil grade: CHF 7.1 (Pentosin).\n\nOpen and close the top several times\nto bleed the hydraulic system.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["»", 0.2006, 0.5232, 0.2016, 0.5245], ["30", 0.2087, 0.5146, 0.2188, 0.5225], ["$4", 0.2224, 0.5146, 0.2325, 0.5232], ["057", 0.2361, 0.5146, 0.2513, 0.5225], ["3054059", 0.2026, 0.9761, 0.2467, 0.9867], ["5434", 0.2741, 0.0743, 0.3019, 0.0855], ["....REMOVING", 0.31, 0.0736, 0.3921, 0.0869], ["COMPLETE", 0.3961, 0.0729, 0.458, 0.0849], ["CONVERTIBLE", 0.3323, 0.0902, 0.4113, 0.1021], ["TOP", 0.4154, 0.0902, 0.4382, 0.1015], ["Remove", 0.2746, 0.1233, 0.3176, 0.1353], ["both", 0.3217, 0.1233, 0.345, 0.1353], ["rear", 0.3495, 0.126, 0.3698, 0.1353], ["side", 0.3739, 0.1233, 0.3961, 0.1353], ["trim", 0.3997, 0.1233, 0.42, 0.1353], ["panels", 0.4245, 0.1233, 0.4595, 0.1379], ["—", 0.463, 0.1293, 0.4696, 0.1313], ["see", 0.2741, 0.1426, 0.2923, 0.1525], ["